                "Welcome to Day 18 of Workplace Soft Skills and the second day of Milestone 3: Tech Career & Interview Mastery. Today we deconstruct the single interview round that software engineers fear most, misunderstand most, and fail most frequently: The Behavioral and Leadership Principles Interview.",
